stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> Validated: authorized type size and checksum validation
Validated --> Quarantine: private storage plus files row
Quarantine --> Scanning: worker bounded private retrieval
Scanning --> Clean: complete clean INSTREAM response
Scanning --> Rejected: known infection response
Scanning --> Quarantine: scanner timeout failure or unavailable
Clean --> Download: authorized clean-only download
Rejected --> Denied: download rejected
Quarantine --> Denied: download rejected
Clean --> DeletionPending: approved delete schedules outbox
Rejected --> DeletionPending: approved delete schedules outbox
DeletionPending --> Removed: bounded idempotent removal
DeletionPending --> Failed: finite retry exhaustion
